# Baked into the bundle by `vite build`, which is what Vercel runs.
#
# Without this the site builds with an empty API base, calls /api/content on its
# own domain, gets a 404 and quietly renders the offline snapshot in
# src/data/fallback.js — text appears, every image 404s. That failure looks like
# a styling bug rather than a connection one, which is why the value lives here
# in the repo instead of only in a hosting dashboard someone has to remember.
#
# No trailing slash.
VITE_API_URL=https://sousannahabdallaportfoliobackend-production.up.railway.app
